## Layout

- `backend/`
  - local website server for the selected backend stack
  - serves `/health`, `/api/status`, and the frontend shell/assets
- `manifest.json`
  - frontend discovery metadata consumed by AutoYou Admin and the connected browser directory
- `frontend/index.html`
  - browser entry page
  - includes `<base href="./">` so generated relative asset/navigation paths stay proxy-safe
- `frontend/`
  - website source files
  - uses relative API calls so AutoYou's `/agent/{{agent_name}}/` prefix stripping stays compatible

